    <string name="onboarding_step_responsible_use_description">Sushi Clash is here to add a little extra fun to your meals, not to turn them into a competition to eat more.\n\nListen to your body, enjoy at your own pace, and do not let a record, goal, or achievement push you to eat more than you want.\n\nHave fun and enjoy! 🍣</string>
